WEBVTT

00:00.740 --> 00:05.970
Your profile looking up
towards the blue sky

00:05.970 --> 00:12.050
The stopped spiral of time

00:12.050 --> 00:18.620
I'm always stubborn
and hiding my feelings

00:18.620 --> 00:25.090
I ache for you so much
(I pine for you so much) that it hurts

00:25.090 --> 00:28.860
I'm not actually that strong

00:28.860 --> 00:36.270
In truth, I become afraid
about the distance between us two

00:36.270 --> 00:42.380
I want you to touch my heart

00:42.380 --> 00:48.080
If I can still reach the goal
taking the long way around

00:48.080 --> 00:49.990
Start line

00:49.990 --> 00:54.560
A story that unravels the heart

00:54.560 --> 01:00.600
I'll say goodbye to tears
and walk towards the future

01:00.600 --> 01:08.400
Because I can go with the kindness
I found clasped to my heart

01:08.400 --> 01:15.240
Please, just for now,
stay the way you are

01:27.690 --> 01:29.920
"Suzuka"

01:31.560 --> 01:34.630
Well, I'm off to school!

01:34.630 --> 01:37.030
Yamato, do you have a handkerchief?

01:37.030 --> 01:39.190
Button up your uniform...

01:42.300 --> 01:45.070
My high school life is about to start!

01:45.070 --> 01:50.310
Yamato, hurry up!
Suzuka is already ahead of us!

01:51.650 --> 01:53.610
Wait, Asahina!

01:55.880 --> 01:59.950
I'm at a new starting line,
and I feel like something will change.

01:59.950 --> 02:03.290
Something good... will happen...

02:05.860 --> 02:11.830
"The Visit"

02:11.830 --> 02:14.490
"New School Year Entrance Ceremony"

02:19.270 --> 02:23.110
No way! You're also in Class C, Yamato?

02:23.110 --> 02:25.110
Suzuka, me too.

02:25.110 --> 02:28.450
What? Does it bother you
that we're in the same class?

02:28.450 --> 02:29.850
Not really...

02:29.850 --> 02:33.420
Not really... Gee thanks.

02:33.420 --> 02:35.620
Can't you get a little more excited?

02:35.620 --> 02:39.390
She even left without me this morning...
She's so stuck-up.

02:46.570 --> 02:49.260
That boy's name... is Akitsuki...

02:54.940 --> 02:56.410
Shopping?

02:56.410 --> 03:01.210
Yeah. Can you go with me after practice?

03:01.210 --> 03:03.080
But why with me?

03:03.080 --> 03:07.750
I was asked to buy a dozen sports drinks,

03:07.750 --> 03:11.320
but my friend who was supposed
to go with me is absent today.

03:11.320 --> 03:13.660
Do you have any commitments already?

03:13.660 --> 03:17.130
N-Nothing really...

03:17.130 --> 03:21.470
Thanks! Then wait for me after school.

03:21.470 --> 03:27.340
Oh well, it sounds like a pain
in the neck, but I'll go with you.

03:27.340 --> 03:29.140
Asahina!

03:29.140 --> 03:30.140
Huh?

03:30.140 --> 03:33.680
You're in Class C,
we're right next to each other!

03:33.680 --> 03:35.120
Well, I'll see you later.

03:35.120 --> 03:36.980
Y-Yeah.

03:39.920 --> 03:43.360
What time does practice start today?

03:43.360 --> 03:44.760
It starts at one o'clock.

03:44.760 --> 03:47.330
Were we supposed to bring something?

03:47.330 --> 03:48.930
Oh, that's cute.

03:48.930 --> 03:50.060
But it's sorta weird.

03:50.060 --> 03:53.130
They're friends from track and field.

03:53.130 --> 03:56.360
She already made friends...

04:00.040 --> 04:01.340
Really?

04:01.340 --> 04:03.810
I'm serious, I saw it!

04:03.810 --> 04:05.110
Wow!

04:05.110 --> 04:08.920
That's cute. Where did you buy it?

04:08.920 --> 04:10.080
It's a secret!

04:10.080 --> 04:15.520
I feel so alienated.
Everyone's friends with everyone else.

04:15.520 --> 04:18.390
Basketball? I don't know the rules.

04:18.390 --> 04:20.860
Doesn't matter, let's join in!

04:25.470 --> 04:28.230
Why do girls talk about
breaking up so often?

04:28.230 --> 04:30.240
They really do, don't they?

04:30.240 --> 04:33.740
They actually don't want to,
they just say that.

04:33.740 --> 04:37.710
Yasunobu is chatting with his friends...

04:37.710 --> 04:40.910
Asahina isn't in the classroom yet...

04:40.910 --> 04:44.650
I'm the only one left out.

04:44.650 --> 04:48.020
Uh... Akitsuki...

04:48.020 --> 04:49.350
Huh?

04:53.160 --> 04:56.820
Well... we're in the same class.

04:57.960 --> 04:59.730
Who... are you?

04:59.730 --> 05:03.740
Huh? You don't... remember?

05:03.740 --> 05:06.510
How about secret...

05:06.510 --> 05:11.210
Oh, I didn't tell you my name yet.

05:11.210 --> 05:14.550
I'm Honoka Sakurai.

05:14.550 --> 05:17.310
Huh? Sakurai?

05:20.920 --> 05:23.860
I forgot to tell him where to meet...

05:26.830 --> 05:29.490
His friend?

05:30.560 --> 05:33.530
Oh? That's Sakurai over there.

05:33.530 --> 05:35.640
Hatori... Do you know her?

05:35.640 --> 05:38.730
Yeah, we went to the
same junior high school...

05:39.940 --> 05:43.780
She usually doesn't
start talking to guys.

05:43.780 --> 05:46.980
Yamato is getting picked up by her!

05:46.980 --> 05:48.720
Aren't they just friends?

05:48.720 --> 05:52.750
Yamato doesn't have
any friends except us!

05:52.750 --> 05:55.890
Yamato is a kind of shy around girls,
so I've been worried about him.

05:55.890 --> 05:58.790
But I'm glad.

05:58.790 --> 06:02.060
They're probably making a date for today.

06:02.060 --> 06:07.470
So, how about the two of us
going out? Are you listening?

06:09.900 --> 06:12.410
Okay everyone, go back to your seats.

06:12.410 --> 06:13.540
T-Talk to you later.

06:13.540 --> 06:15.410
Y-Yeah.

06:17.010 --> 06:18.180
Oh! Sorry!

06:18.180 --> 06:22.780
Sakurai... Honoka Sakurai...

06:22.780 --> 06:26.180
Who is she? I really don't remember.

06:32.760 --> 06:36.220
Well, I'll wait for Asahina.

06:38.430 --> 06:41.830
Now where were we supposed to meet?

06:43.340 --> 06:46.870
Uh... Akitsuki...

06:46.870 --> 06:48.340
Honoka.

06:49.480 --> 06:52.350
S-Sorry... hold on sec...

06:52.350 --> 06:55.510
Oh, Asahina! About our shopping today...

06:56.850 --> 07:00.620
It's okay. I'll go by myself.

07:00.620 --> 07:01.860
Huh?

07:01.860 --> 07:03.910
Sorry, I'm in a hurry.

07:04.920 --> 07:06.860
Wait!

07:06.860 --> 07:08.900
Hey, Asahina!

07:08.900 --> 07:12.900
W-What's her problem?
I really don't understand.

07:12.900 --> 07:17.500
Um... Akitsuki, is she...

07:17.500 --> 07:22.240
Huh? She's my friend. But she's so crazy.

07:23.840 --> 07:26.050
A friend...

07:26.050 --> 07:30.650
By the way, have we met
somewhere before?

07:30.650 --> 07:33.720
I really can't remember.

07:33.720 --> 07:36.760
When I was in elementary school...

07:36.760 --> 07:42.200
I saw you at my family's shrine...
Inari Shrine which you often visit.

07:42.200 --> 07:44.760
My family's shrine?

07:44.760 --> 07:47.600
You mean your family runs that shrine?

07:51.240 --> 07:57.110
Yes... When I played with the bell
and broke it a long time ago...

07:57.110 --> 08:01.450
Oh no! Daddy will be so upset with me.

08:01.450 --> 08:04.040
Oh, you broke the bell.

08:09.790 --> 08:13.430
That's bad. I bet you
hung from it, didn't you?

08:13.430 --> 08:16.060
Um... I'm sorry.

08:16.060 --> 08:22.160
I thought you were going to
tell my dad that I broke the bell...

08:23.900 --> 08:27.310
Stop crying. I'll fix it.

08:27.310 --> 08:29.640
This dent isn't so bad...

08:29.640 --> 08:30.580
It's impossible...

08:30.580 --> 08:33.570
Don't worry, I'll take care of it.

08:40.450 --> 08:42.510
Wow!

08:43.690 --> 08:46.860
Look, this is between you and me.

08:46.860 --> 08:51.520
O-Okay. It's our secret.

08:55.700 --> 08:58.500
Just between you and me...

08:59.540 --> 09:02.340
Oh! Now I remember...

09:02.340 --> 09:05.350
I'm glad you remember it.

09:05.350 --> 09:09.520
Actually, sometimes I went
there and ate croquettes.

09:09.520 --> 09:12.920
Oh, really...

09:12.920 --> 09:18.760
Actually, I saw you often
eating croquettes there...

09:18.760 --> 09:22.460
Akitsuki, do you like croquettes?

09:22.460 --> 09:25.870
Not only croquettes,
but I like everything tasty!

09:25.870 --> 09:29.570
Well, do you know about
the new okonomiyaki restaurant

09:29.570 --> 09:30.570
near the train station?

09:30.570 --> 09:34.610
Oh, yeah. I've been wanting to go there!

09:34.610 --> 09:36.440
R-Really?

09:36.440 --> 09:39.680
Well... How about... Um...

09:39.680 --> 09:44.780
Can... we... go... there... today?

09:44.780 --> 09:46.920
Um... Today?

09:46.920 --> 09:50.660
I-it's okay, if you can't.

09:50.660 --> 09:54.590
I just asked you...

09:54.590 --> 09:58.730
It's okay. I'll go by myself.

09:58.730 --> 10:01.200
I really don't understand her!

10:01.200 --> 10:05.140
Why should I wait for her
after she says that to me?!

10:05.140 --> 10:06.230
Oh...

10:08.980 --> 10:10.340
Huh?

10:34.970 --> 10:37.570
Boy, we had a long practice today.

10:37.570 --> 10:44.380
Asahina, don't forget
the dozen sports drinks, okay?

10:44.380 --> 10:45.440
Okay.

10:50.180 --> 10:55.090
A dozen... I'll need to make
two trips to carry them all.

10:55.090 --> 10:58.060
I wish Yamato were here to help me.

10:58.060 --> 11:00.790
They're probably making a date for today.

11:02.130 --> 11:04.260
He's so wishy washy!

11:04.260 --> 11:06.460
Don't tell me if you can't do it!

11:08.870 --> 11:10.360
Oh...

11:12.670 --> 11:17.080
How long do I have to wait
for you? Be more considerate!

11:17.080 --> 11:18.310
Y-Yamato!

11:18.310 --> 11:21.210
Did you wait for me? For five hours?

11:21.210 --> 11:25.740
I didn't have much choice.
It's too heavy for you to carry, right?

11:40.670 --> 11:44.240
Yamato... Akitsuki...

11:44.240 --> 11:49.680
Sorry, Honoka. But I'm supposed
to go shopping with Suzuka today...

11:49.680 --> 11:53.550
I don't want to, but she needs some help.

11:53.550 --> 11:56.950
He's very kind... and honest...

11:56.950 --> 12:01.250
You're really nuts!
Who'd wait for five hours!

12:01.250 --> 12:02.790
Huh?

12:02.790 --> 12:06.430
Hey! Who do you think I did this for?!

12:06.430 --> 12:08.800
It was damn cold!

12:08.800 --> 12:12.160
Are you listening to me, Asahina!

12:14.330 --> 12:17.100
"Shusse Inari"

12:34.590 --> 12:37.690
Good morning, Akitsuki.

12:37.690 --> 12:42.330
Hey! I got a cold because
I was waiting for you!

12:42.330 --> 12:45.670
How can you say I'm crazy!

12:45.670 --> 12:50.940
I didn't ask you to wait,
so don't blame me.

12:50.940 --> 12:51.970
Say that again?

12:51.970 --> 12:56.710
You'd better go to bed, Yamato.
I already notified the school.

12:56.710 --> 12:59.610
That's right. You don't
want to get worse, right?

13:01.810 --> 13:04.120
I'm off to school now.

13:04.120 --> 13:06.550
I don't want to catch a cold
before the meet.

13:06.550 --> 13:08.720
Hey, wait.

13:08.720 --> 13:11.320
Go ahead and take this medicine, Yamato.

13:11.320 --> 13:13.690
Right, or you'll die, Yamato.

13:20.130 --> 13:22.640
Let me take attendance.

13:22.640 --> 13:25.940
Akitsuki is absent with a cold.

13:25.940 --> 13:27.210
Asahina.

13:27.210 --> 13:28.140
Yes.

13:28.140 --> 13:29.340
Inoue.

13:29.340 --> 13:30.740
Here.

13:30.740 --> 13:35.580
Akitsuki has a cold. I hope he's OK...

13:35.580 --> 13:38.280
School just stared...
and that idiot already is sick...

13:38.280 --> 13:41.150
Who catches a cold in April?

13:49.230 --> 13:52.160
Asahina, sorry about yesterday.

13:52.160 --> 13:55.840
I had no idea that your partner was out.

13:55.840 --> 13:58.470
One dozen must've been very heavy.

13:58.470 --> 14:02.280
But another friend helped me.

14:02.280 --> 14:04.570
That's good.

14:06.850 --> 14:10.720
Actually, I could've managed by myself.

14:10.720 --> 14:12.380
Really?

14:22.360 --> 14:26.270
I feel like... I'm getting worse...

14:26.270 --> 14:31.040
Sorry, Yamato. But I'll be busy
until late tonight...

14:31.040 --> 14:33.770
Miho will be home by around five.

14:35.210 --> 14:40.110
Ayano and Miho
won't come back for a while...

14:40.110 --> 14:43.600
I... might die, Goro...

14:45.280 --> 14:48.880
Asahina will... No, that'll never happen...

14:50.020 --> 14:52.860
Can that be... Asahina?

14:52.860 --> 14:54.720
What's up?

14:56.730 --> 14:58.970
Wh... at?

14:58.970 --> 15:03.900
Speak up louder!
One more time! What's up!

15:03.900 --> 15:06.540
Go home. You make me more tired.

15:06.540 --> 15:10.070
Are you sure? I've brought a girl.

15:11.410 --> 15:15.980
Uh... Are you... all right, Akitsuki?

15:15.980 --> 15:18.620
H-Honoka?

15:18.620 --> 15:19.420
"Yamato Akitsuki"

15:19.420 --> 15:23.090
"Yamato Akitsuki"
She insisted on coming to visit you.

15:23.090 --> 15:25.560
"Yamato Akitsuki"
No, I didn't...

15:25.560 --> 15:31.230
It's okay. I'm gonna get some
orange juice and leave you guys alone.

15:31.230 --> 15:33.070
So enjoy yourselves!

15:33.070 --> 15:34.500
Stop it!

15:38.600 --> 15:40.310
Akitsuki...

15:40.310 --> 15:43.580
Are you all right?
Sorry for coming by when you're sick.

15:43.580 --> 15:45.340
I-It's okay.

15:46.350 --> 15:48.910
This is your room...

15:48.910 --> 15:51.020
There's a cat!

15:51.020 --> 15:53.050
Sorry, the room is messy.

15:53.050 --> 15:55.120
N-No, it's not.

15:55.120 --> 15:59.110
Well, it's very nice of you
to come visit me.

16:00.930 --> 16:05.300
Although Asahina lives next door,
she didn't even visit me.

16:05.300 --> 16:09.500
What? Asahina lives here?

16:09.500 --> 16:15.140
Oh, didn't I tell you yet?
This is my aunt's complex.

16:15.140 --> 16:17.580
I see...

16:17.580 --> 16:20.950
That's why they're close friends...

16:20.950 --> 16:24.720
Uh... Are you hungry, Akitsuki?

16:24.720 --> 16:28.590
Not really. I don't have an appetite now...

16:28.590 --> 16:33.090
That's not good. You need to eat,
especially when you're sick.

16:33.090 --> 16:34.990
Can I make you something?

16:34.990 --> 16:36.530
R-Really?

16:36.530 --> 16:41.470
Yeah. Believe me.
I'll make something tasty...

16:41.470 --> 16:43.800
But I don't have any cooking utensils.

16:43.800 --> 16:47.670
Don't worry. My house is near by,
so I'll bring something.

16:50.480 --> 16:54.180
That's right... I live close to him, too.

16:54.180 --> 16:57.410
If I try hard enough, maybe I can
become closer to him than Asahina.

17:02.590 --> 17:04.720
Asahina...

17:04.720 --> 17:07.860
Is she going to visit Yamato?

17:07.860 --> 17:11.660
Oh hi, Sakurai.
I didn't know you were here.

17:11.660 --> 17:16.100
Yeah. I was going to make
some food for Akitsuki.

17:16.100 --> 17:20.710
I see... Please tell him to get well soon.

17:20.710 --> 17:24.040
Uh... Asahina. Don't you want to see him?

17:24.040 --> 17:26.910
No, I don't want to catch his cold.

17:26.910 --> 17:28.640
O-Okay.

17:30.280 --> 17:33.680
They may not be such close friends...

17:36.260 --> 17:41.960
Oh! I'd better in hurry! I'll go home
and make something for him.

17:48.330 --> 17:50.870
Boy, that was really delicious!

17:50.870 --> 17:52.370
Thanks for dinner.

17:52.370 --> 17:54.070
Uh... well...

17:54.070 --> 17:58.210
You're such a good cook, Honoka.

17:58.210 --> 18:01.450
Yeah. I especially like
the flavor of the bonito broth.

18:01.450 --> 18:04.550
Honoka, how about me?

18:04.550 --> 18:07.750
Sorry, it's all gone.

18:07.750 --> 18:12.830
Don't worry, Yamato.
You won't die from skipping a meal.

18:12.830 --> 18:13.990
That's right.

18:13.990 --> 18:19.000
What are you guys doing here?
My fever is getting...

18:19.000 --> 18:23.900
Don't worry, Yamato.
I'll take care of your cold.

18:23.900 --> 18:26.970
Here we go. I'll give you a shot.

18:26.970 --> 18:28.300
No!

18:31.010 --> 18:34.580
What the hell is that?
I don't care for those things!

18:34.580 --> 18:37.020
Really?

18:37.020 --> 18:38.880
How about this?

18:38.880 --> 18:41.520
Okay, open up your jammies.

18:41.520 --> 18:42.720
Stop it!

18:42.720 --> 18:45.020
Be quiet! Hold his legs, Hatori!

18:45.020 --> 18:46.430
Okay.

18:46.430 --> 18:49.490
- Don't move!
- Whoa! Stop it!

18:51.060 --> 18:53.900
It sounds loud upstairs...

18:53.900 --> 19:00.210
Hatori and Sakurai are visiting Yamato.
Oh, Saotome, too.

19:00.210 --> 19:04.210
Should I leave his dinner here?

19:04.210 --> 19:10.250
He'll be fine. Because Sakurai
told me she's cooking for him.

19:10.250 --> 19:12.620
Then let me take this away.

19:12.620 --> 19:14.920
Oh... Hey, Goro.

19:14.920 --> 19:18.150
Goro is going to have his dinner, Mom.

19:23.560 --> 19:26.590
They all finally left, but...

19:27.900 --> 19:29.700
...I'm starving...

19:29.700 --> 19:35.160
I can't believe Asahina didn't
come to visit me at all.

19:36.910 --> 19:40.040
I caught a cold because
I was waiting for you!

19:41.010 --> 19:43.240
Humph, that's not my fault!

19:56.260 --> 19:58.530
Maybe I should try it...

19:58.530 --> 20:02.370
Damn! I'm starving! I feel awful!

20:02.370 --> 20:05.130
You're such an ingrate, Asahina!

20:07.440 --> 20:10.440
Hey, why are you guys coming back!?

20:10.440 --> 20:11.410
Oh, Asahina...

20:11.410 --> 20:13.610
The door wasn't locked...

20:15.210 --> 20:17.980
It's not my fault if you catch my cold.

20:17.980 --> 20:22.250
Well, then you can
pay for medicine at least.

20:22.250 --> 20:23.390
Here we go.

20:23.390 --> 20:24.660
What's that?

20:24.660 --> 20:26.660
I had nothing to do, so I just made it.

20:26.660 --> 20:30.360
Well, I know you're stuffed
with Sakurai's food...

20:30.360 --> 20:32.600
Really? You're a lifesaver!

20:32.600 --> 20:33.270
Huh?

20:33.270 --> 20:37.840
I'm really starving! Thank you, Asahina!

20:37.840 --> 20:42.640
Really? Why didn't you
tell me that earlier...

20:42.640 --> 20:43.680
What's this?

20:43.680 --> 20:45.270
A honey and lemon drink...

20:46.910 --> 20:48.610
...without the honey.

20:48.610 --> 20:50.280
It's sour!

20:50.280 --> 20:52.280
I didn't have honey...

20:52.280 --> 20:54.550
Then, it's just a lemon drink!

20:56.020 --> 20:58.260
Sorry. You don't have to finish it.

20:58.260 --> 21:01.490
No way. I'm starving right now.

21:01.490 --> 21:02.560
I'll finish it no matter what!

21:02.560 --> 21:03.700
Huh?

21:03.700 --> 21:08.500
Besides, no one else
would drink anything so sour.

21:08.500 --> 21:10.370
Yamato...

21:10.370 --> 21:13.240
Actually, it's not so bad having a cold...

21:13.240 --> 21:14.360
Really sour...

21:16.040 --> 21:19.650
But I guess anyone can boil eggs.

21:19.650 --> 21:23.100
Well sure, I just put them in the microwave.

21:27.420 --> 21:30.590
W-What's wrong?

21:30.590 --> 21:33.290
You can't just make everything
in a microwave!

21:33.290 --> 21:35.830
Oh, I can't?

21:35.830 --> 21:37.760
Isn't it obvious?

21:40.530 --> 21:45.940
I'll become the wind
on the green field

21:45.940 --> 21:48.740
Right now, I'll just...

21:48.740 --> 21:55.880
Get a little "reckless"
and "fired up" and speed up

21:55.880 --> 21:56.550
Let's go

21:56.550 --> 21:57.310
Run

21:57.310 --> 21:57.920
Stop

21:57.920 --> 21:58.550
Advance

21:58.550 --> 21:59.250
Falter

21:59.250 --> 21:59.920
Jump

21:59.920 --> 22:01.890
Squat

22:01.890 --> 22:02.520
Sing

22:02.520 --> 22:03.190
Shout

22:03.190 --> 22:03.990
Triumph

22:03.990 --> 22:04.490
Fall short

22:04.490 --> 22:06.660
I'll live, right here

22:06.660 --> 22:12.100
Living recklessly like this
isn't altogether bad, either

22:12.100 --> 22:17.690
Something'll happen,
I have this feeling

22:19.440 --> 22:22.370
Day after day
of getting covered in bruises

22:24.810 --> 22:32.450
Some days, I feel my "limit", though...

22:32.450 --> 22:37.520
I'll become the wind
on the green field

22:37.520 --> 22:43.190
I'll run right through the moment

22:43.190 --> 22:48.330
The shapes of things change,
it's just the way it is

22:48.330 --> 22:51.040
You can't stop it...

22:51.040 --> 22:54.100
A little "stubborn" and "mischievous"

22:54.100 --> 22:57.940
"Competitive"

22:57.940 --> 22:58.610
That spirit

22:58.610 --> 22:59.280
Run

22:59.280 --> 22:59.940
Stop

22:59.940 --> 23:00.480
Advance

23:00.480 --> 23:01.110
Falter

23:01.110 --> 23:01.750
Jump

23:01.750 --> 23:03.980
Squat

23:03.980 --> 23:04.480
Sing

23:04.480 --> 23:05.150
Shout

23:05.150 --> 23:05.980
Triumph

23:05.980 --> 23:06.680
Fall short

23:06.680 --> 23:09.850
I'll live, right here

23:10.620 --> 23:13.120
Okay, let's practice.

23:13.120 --> 23:18.360
A-Asahina, I forgot my umbrella,
so can I share yours?

23:18.360 --> 23:20.100
If you don't want to, that's fine.

23:20.100 --> 23:20.600
What is he doing?!

23:20.600 --> 23:22.200
"Next episode: Spring Storm"
What is he doing?!

23:22.200 --> 23:23.630
"Next episode: Spring Storm"
Could he be a stalker?

23:23.630 --> 23:24.860
"Next episode: Spring Storm"
